WEBVTT

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:07.818
With the Orchard Core AI Agent feature on, the Tools section of the

00:00:07.818 --> 00:00:13.129
same tab lists the actions that an assistant can take on this site, in groups:

00:00:13.129 --> 00:00:19.262
content definitions, content, features, recipes, roles, users, the time zones and the date.

00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:22.849
Select All in a group ticks every tool of the group.

00:00:22.849 --> 00:00:26.906
These tools can change the site, so give them only to assistants that

00:00:26.906 --> 00:00:29.502
need them, and to people who may use them.

